   MORE SPOILERS!!!


	If you have a magic whistle, whenever your pet picks
up something you want, use the whistle.  The pet will be teleported
to you, and will drop the item. Most of the time the item will
be dropped on a square you can retrieve the item from, i.e.
directly in front of the door, or outside the door.

Enjoy!
